| RISC3D test: textures as TORCS uses them: several units at once (in
| immediate mode and in arrays, with texture matrices) and big textures
| with every mipmap level. Writes TexResults and TexPicture (PPM);
| linux-tests writes TexLinuxResults and TexLinuxPicture to compare.
RMEnsure RISC3D 0.03 Error Install riscos-risc3d 0.12-1 first (see !ReadMe)
RMEnsure Linux3D 0.02 Error Install riscos-risc3d 0.12-1 first (see !ReadMe)
Run <Obey$Dir>.gl1test multi <Obey$Dir>.TexPicture { > <Obey$Dir>.TexResults }
Run <Obey$Dir>.gl1test bigtex { >> <Obey$Dir>.TexResults }
SetType <Obey$Dir>.TexResults Text
Filer_Run <Obey$Dir>.TexResults
